  "wrap": "Reviewed prior metformin 500 mg 30-day fill costs: $8 at preferred Oak Street Pharmacy on August 18 and $27 at standard Lakeview Pharmacy on September 16; the difference reflected network cost-share category. Confirmed the prescription allows up to a 90-day supply and explained that the 90-day option does not place an order, start automatic refills, or change today’s pickup. Submitted enrollment for future metformin fills through CenterWell pharmacy service; atorvastatin remains at retail. A Jardiance 10 mg coverage request is pending review.\n\nConnection result: DEMO-TRANSFER001 — receiving_specialist_connected. DEMO-CVR001 remains pending_review. Connection is not a coverage determination.\n\nDEMO-ENR001 · metformin · ready · DEMO-CVR001",
